        "@type": "Answer",
        "text": "A High Endurance-Associated Profile means the pigeon carries a higher proportion of genetic markers statistically associated with endurance-related biological functions. These markers may be linked to aerobic metabolism, energy utilization efficiency, recovery capacity, neurological response, or long-distance adaptation. However, genetic association does not guarantee superior racing results."
      }
    },
    {
      "@type": "Question",
